OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for killing 86-year-old
OL,4,Aduring break-in
OL,5,
OL,6,FA prolific burglar who headbutted and
OL,7,Fkilled an 86-year-old pensioner as he
OL,8,Ftried to protect his 91-year-old wife
OL,9,Fhas been jailed for 18 years and
OL,10,Fordered to serve another five years on
OL,11,Flicence.
OL,13,FAshley Malcolm, 40, who admitted
OL,14,Fmanslaughter and a string of other
OL,15,Foffences, attacked John Burke while
OL,16,Fburgling the couple's flat in Hackney,
OL,17,Fnorth London, late on 29 September.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
