OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for killing 86-year-old
OL,4,Aduring break-in
OL,5,
OL,6,FDuring sentencing at the Old Bailey,
OL,7,FJudge Simon Mayo KC, said: "You entered
OL,8,Fthe home of two elderly and vulnerable
OL,9,Foccupants. The burglary took place over
OL,10,Fa prolonged period."
OL,12,FReece Lambert told the court that he
OL,13,Fbelieved his grandfather was attacked
OL,14,Fas he "protected the woman he loved
OL,15,Fwith everything he had left".
